<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Verify your email</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
    
    <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
        <h2 style="color: #4a90e2;">Legacy Bridge Publishing</h2>
    </div>

    <div style="background-color: #f9f9f9; padding: 20px; border-radius: 5px;">
        <p>Hello {{name}},</p>
        
        <p>Thank you for registering an account. Please verify your email address to complete your registration using the OTP code below:</p>

        <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
            <div style="background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 15px 30px; display: inline-block; font-size: 24px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 5px; color: #333;">
                {{verifyCode}}
            </div>
        </div>

        <p>This code is valid for 2 hours. If you did not request this, please ignore this email.</p>
        
        <p style="margin-top: 30px;">Best regards,<br>The Legacy Bridge Publishing Team</p>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
